This repository contains a derivative of the model "emi08/maske"
(https://huggingface.co/emi08/maske), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Modifications: fine-tuned on synthetic Turkish chat-style messages (no real
personal data), exported to ONNX (opset 17) and dynamically quantized to int8
(onnxruntime.quantization.quantize_dynamic) for in-browser use by Perde AI.
The ONNX file is split into two byte-exact parts.
